1
00:00:00,293 --> 00:00:01,463
(Penny:)But what if you need it?

2
00:00:01,628 --> 00:00:05,468
My expenses account for 46.9 percent
of my after-tax income.

3
00:00:05,632 --> 00:00:08,302
(Sheldon:)The rest is divvied up
between a small savings account...

4
00:00:08,468 --> 00:00:10,678
(Sheldon:)...this deceptive container
of peanut brittle...

5
00:00:10,845 --> 00:00:13,935
(Sheldon:)...and the hollowed-out buttocks
of a superhero action figure...

6
00:00:14,099 --> 00:00:17,189
(Sheldon:)...who shall remain nameless
for his own protection.

7
00:00:19,354 --> 00:00:22,854
(Sheldon:)Or her own protection.

8
00:00:25,443 --> 00:00:28,153
(Sheldon:)- Take some.
- Really? I mean, are you sure?

9
00:00:28,321 --> 00:00:30,201
(Sheldon:)I see no large upcoming expenditures.

10
00:00:30,365 --> 00:00:32,825
Unless they develop technology
to fuse my skeleton...

11
00:00:32,993 --> 00:00:35,573
(Sheldon:)...with Adamantium like Wolverine.

12
00:00:36,788 --> 00:00:39,128
(Penny:)Are they working on that?

13
00:00:39,291 --> 00:00:41,501
(Sheldon:)I sincerely hope so.

14
00:00:43,878 --> 00:00:47,218
(Penny:)Okay. Well, thank you.

15
00:00:50,802 --> 00:01:04,022
(Leonard:)Hmm.

